{
  "slug": "youtube-transcriber",
  "name": "Youtube Transcriber",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Transcribe YouTube videos and playlists using browser-based caption extraction. Works with any video that has auto-generated or manual captions — no API key, no external service, zero configuration. Supports single videos and full playlists in any language. Outputs timestamped transcripts ready for further processing.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `youtube-transcriber` (Transcribe YouTube videos and playlists by extracting auto-generated captions directly from the browser — no API key, no…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install youtube-transcriber@claude-community` from `MSApps-Mobile/claude-plugins` (`plugins/youtube-transcriber`).",
